        {
          "text": "alimwi wakamupa pepa lyakalembedwe cilaililo cakabambwa akutuminwa maleya mu-Susa caamba lunyonyoono lwabo, ndyaelede kumutondezya akumupandulwida Esita; alimwi wakamulaya kuti ainke kumwami, akumbile akombelele akaambo kabantu bakwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.4.8",
